OL,3,GNEWSAIs this the end for small-scale
OL,4,Apig farming?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is a record low," said Dan
OL,7,FBolton, a pig farmer from north Dorset.
OL,9,FBolton, who has farmed rare breed
OL,10,Fsaddlebacks in Fontmell Magna for
OL,11,Fnearly a decade, recently sold nine,
OL,12,Fseven-week-old piglets at market for
OL,13,Fjust #2 each.
OL,15,F"If this carries on, it will be the end
OL,16,Fof the road for many UK pig farmers,
OL,17,Feven the larger guys," he said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
