OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIs this the end for small-scale
OL,4,Apig farming?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBolton's fears are echoed by many
OL,7,Facross the farming industry. According
OL,8,Fto the National Pig Association (NPA),
OL,9,Fwhich represents commercial producers,
OL,10,Fdemand for pork is falling and
OL,11,Findependent producers are selling up.
